ist. Keep the non-obvious behavior: Cloud send path fits then normalizes; description sanitizer fits only; exactly 1 real shared mapping implementation with protocol stub and pure delegation excluded; ADF entry points remain allowlisted. Preserve every executable AST node, assertion, directive, fixture value, and other comment. Record exact before/final citations and strict word reductions. Run the file's focused pytest, scoped Ruff/format, comment hygiene, diff check, and full `make verify` from the worktree venv. Send this leaf with the repo-root copied-docstring follow-up as 1 grouped Gerrit change.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Exactly 6 allowlisted prose blocks are shorter and all other prose is unchanged.\n- [ ] The 4 named rich-text contracts remain explicit and the test behavior/AST are unchanged.\n- [ ] A nonauthor reviewer agent posts 6 leaf-linked TSV rows with full before/final SHA:path#stable-ID citations, contract, before/after words, directive exactness, semantic preservation, bloat removal, and reviewer session; every verdict is PASS.\n- [ ] All recorded focused, structural, hygiene, diff, and untimed full verification commands exit 0.\n- [ ] The grouped Gerrit change receives LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, zero unresolved comments, merges, and exact merged-SHA review receipts are read back.\n- [ ] Standalone completion verification passes and the ticket closes after merge.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_seam.py","reason":"Condense copied or moved test prose in the current live file; preserve executable AST, directives, and named consumer contracts."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["parent","bea4-b9cc-18cc-40c4"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"bea4-b9cc-18cc-40c4","parent_status_uuid":"17fdd768-1b18-4cdf-9431-4c2809096a3b","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary